        <mxCell id="nRules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• payments: one row per tender, so split payments just work&lt;br&gt;• loyalty_ledger is append-only; customers.PointsBalance is a cached sum&lt;br&gt;• sale, items, payments, stock, points and outbox rows are written in one transaction&lt;br&gt;• money is DECIMAL, never FLOAT" vertex="1">
