        <mxCell id="nEnum" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;ENUM values &amp;amp; lookup rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;terminals.DeviceType: DESKTOP, WEB, MOBILE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tax:&lt;/b&gt; tax_rates.StateID null = country-wide rate; the rate&lt;br&gt;used is the one valid on the sale date (ValidFrom/To).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Price:&lt;/b&gt; store price list → country (regional) list →&lt;br&gt;organisation default (StoreID and CountryID both null),&lt;br&gt;then by Priority and the valid date range." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="370" x="40" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nRules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every master table also carries OrganisationID (tenant key),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UpdatedAt, RowVersion and IsDeleted: not drawn, to keep lines readable.&lt;br&gt;• Masters are created in the back office (INT/BIGINT ids);&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;terminals only pull them by RowVersion (&amp;quot;changes since token&amp;quot;).&lt;br&gt;• Currency comes from countries.CurrencyCode; time zone from stores.&lt;br&gt;• Receipt no. = StoreCode-TerminalCode-Seq, so offline tills never clash." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="700" x="40" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#777777;fontSize=11;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="crow&#39;s foot = many · double bar = exactly one · circle + bar = zero or one" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="600" x="40" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
