        <mxCell id="imgNote2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=10;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="Path prefix = tenantId, so one tenant can never read another&#39;s images" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="660" x="1360" y="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Key rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A tenant lives on exactly one shard; the tenant → shard map is cached in Redis (fallback: tenant catalog DB).&lt;br&gt;• Rebalance by online migration: copy tenant rows, catch up from binlog, flip the map entry, drain.&lt;br&gt;• Partition column must be in every PK / unique key: PK (TenantID, SaleID, BusinessDate). Pre-create next month&#39;s partition.&lt;br&gt;• Writes → primary only. Reads → replicas (accept ~1 s lag); read-your-own-write screens use the primary.&lt;br&gt;• Cache key format t:{tenantId}:s:{storeId}:{type}:{id} · TTLs: prices/tax 10 min, catalog 30 min, shard map 1 h · invalidated from CDC.&lt;br&gt;• CDC topics cdc.{shard}.{table} keyed by TenantID keep per-tenant ordering; consumers are idempotent (upsert by primary key)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="2010" x="30" y="1210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
