        <mxCell id="nRules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Multi-tenant + scale rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• TenantID (red row) leads every PK and index; FKs are composite, e.g. (TenantID, POID).&lt;br&gt;• ▦ journal_lines and sync_inbox are PARTITION BY RANGE (BusinessDate), monthly;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the partition column is in the PK. Old months go to Blob, then are dropped.&lt;br&gt;• sync_inbox key (TenantID, ClientRecordID, BusinessDate): a re-sent push is a DUPLICATE.&lt;br&gt;• 3-way match before paying; every journal entry balances (Debit = Credit).&lt;br&gt;• Cross-tenant queries forbidden (EF Core global filter); Fabric fed by CDC." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="520" x="640" y="1260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#777777;fontSize=11;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="crow&#39;s foot = many · double bar = exactly one · circle + bar = zero or one · grey dashed = reference copy · red row = TenantID · ▦ = monthly partitions" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="1000" x="40" y="1430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
