        <mxCell id="nEnum" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;ENUM values&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;orders.Channel: POS, WEB, DOORDASH, UBER_EATS&lt;br&gt;orders.Status: RECEIVED, ACCEPTED, PREPARING, READY,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, COMPLETED, REJECTED,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;CANCELLED, REFUNDED&lt;br&gt;order_status_history.Actor: STORE, SHOPPER, CHANNEL,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SYSTEM_TIMER&lt;br&gt;fulfilments.Type: PICKUP, OWN_DELIVERY, THIRD_PARTY_DELIVERY&lt;br&gt;fulfilments.Status: PENDING, PICKING, READY, HANDED_OVER,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DELIVERED, FAILED&lt;br&gt;stock_reservations.Status: HELD, CONSUMED, RELEASED, EXPIRED" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="235" width="345" x="40" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nRules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• One orders table for every channel; a POS sale gets a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Channel=POS order linked 1:1 (orders.SaleID).&lt;br&gt;• (TenantID, Channel, ExternalOrderId) unique: an&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;aggregator webhook sent twice makes one order.&lt;br&gt;• Web cart lives in Redis (TTL 24 h), not in MySQL.&lt;br&gt;• Reservation TTL 15 min unpaid; held until fulfilled when paid.&lt;br&gt;• Available-to-sell = on hand − reserved − safety stock.&lt;br&gt;• Stock leaves via stock_movements (Reason ONLINE_SALE)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;when the order is READY / COMPLETED.&lt;br&gt;• ▦ = PARTITION BY RANGE (BusinessDate) monthly;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;TenantID leads every PK and index." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="345" x="40" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#777777;fontSize=11;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="crow&#39;s foot = many · double bar = exactly one · circle + bar = zero or one · grey dashed = reference copy · red row = TenantID · ▦ = monthly partitions" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="1300" x="40" y="1530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
