        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt; · every capture method (biometric, face + liveness, mobile geofence + selfie, rotating QR, NFC / RFID, POS PIN, web, manager entry) becomes one punch event on Event Hubs. · Devices and apps buffer offline; the punch id makes replays harmless. · Raw punches live in Cosmos DB; rosters, daily attendance, regularizations and locks live in the Attendance MySQL DB (TenantID first in every key). · Exceptions open regularization requests; approval runs in Logic Apps. · A locked period can only be reopened by HR and is audited. · Biometric templates are not stored centrally without consent." vertex="1">
