        <mxCell id="ctx" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Every signal carries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• dimensions: tenant.id · store.id · service · version · region · tenancy.mode (pooled / dedicated / on-prem / hybrid)&lt;br&gt;• W3C traceparent + baggage across REST → GraphQL BFF → gRPC → Service Bus / Event Hubs → Functions&lt;br&gt;• logs carry trace_id / span_id, so a payment, sync batch or payroll run is one clickable trace&lt;br&gt;• PII (names, phone, bank, biometrics) is redacted in the collector, never logged" vertex="1">
