        <mxCell id="checks" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Method checks (step “Method checks pass?”)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• terminals / badges: device enrolled + healthy in Device Management, employee enrolled on it&lt;br&gt;• face (tablet): liveness score ≥ threshold, match score ≥ threshold, tablet bound to the store&lt;br&gt;• mobile: inside store geofence (≤ GeofenceMeters), no mock location / rooted device, phone bound to employee, selfie stored&lt;br&gt;• QR: signed token, ≤ 30 s old, store matches the employee&#39;s assignment&lt;br&gt;• web: source IP in the store / office allow-list · manual: reason + manager role, always audited&lt;br&gt;• POS PIN: terminal belongs to the store, PIN lockout after 5 tries" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="800" x="920" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="offline" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Offline first&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every capture point queues punches locally and replays them when online. Each punch keeps PunchID (ULID), device time, server receipt time, method, device ID and geo / liveness scores, so late arrivals are matched to the right day and duplicates are dropped." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="640" x="60" y="1020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
