        <mxCell id="nDur" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Durable Functions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every activity retries 3× with backoff. A failing employee is marked ERROR and skipped until fixed (C). The orchestration history makes the run resumable after a crash." vertex="1">
