        <mxCell id="nSec" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Also&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• store scope: roles apply only to the stores in the user&#39;s assignments&lt;br&gt;• payroll.run and payroll.approve never on the same person (four-eyes)&lt;br&gt;• tokens: access 60 min, refresh rotating (idle 24 h, max 30 days); device token 24 h&lt;br&gt;• TLS 1.2+ everywhere, HSTS on every hostname&lt;br&gt;• PII masked in logs and responses unless the scope allows it&lt;br&gt;• secrets and signing keys only in Key Vault (rotated 90 days)" vertex="1">
