        <mxCell id="wsRules" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• server → client push only; clients never publish to each other&lt;br&gt;• messages are notifications {type, id, version}; no PII; client then fetches details by GraphQL / REST&lt;br&gt;• reliable subprotocol (json.reliable.webpubsub.azure.v1): sequence ids + ack, replay on reconnect&lt;br&gt;• fallback poll every 30 s; a missed push never loses data (database + events are the truth)&lt;br&gt;• clients may join only groups of their own tenant (enforced in the token)&lt;br&gt;• on-premise / hybrid: self-hosted ASP.NET Core SignalR hub + Redis backplane, same negotiate contract" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="620" x="40" y="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
