        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cross-context flow (events, not shared transactions)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Employee → Attendance / Leave / Payroll: EmployeeHired, EmployeeExited&lt;br&gt;• Leave → Attendance: LeaveApproved marks days as LEAVE&lt;br&gt;• Attendance → Payroll: AttendancePeriodLocked; summary read over gRPC&lt;br&gt;• Sales → Payroll: SaleCompleted feeds commission&lt;br&gt;• Payroll → Accounting / Bank: PayrollRunApproved, PayrollRunPaid" vertex="1">
