        <mxCell id="tests" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Test pyramid for this service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• domain unit tests (most): aggregates, value objects, invariants; no mocks needed&lt;br&gt;• application tests: handlers with in-memory fakes of the ports&lt;br&gt;• adapter / integration tests: Testcontainers (MySQL, Redis), Service Bus emulator&lt;br&gt;• contract tests: OpenAPI / Pact, protobuf (buf breaking), GraphQL schema checks&lt;br&gt;• a few end-to-end tests in QA (Playwright)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="740" x="40" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• domain project references nothing but the Shared Kernel (Money, TenantId, StoreId, BusinessDate, Ulid)&lt;br&gt;• one aggregate per transaction; events leave through the outbox&lt;br&gt;• other contexts are reached only through ports + ACL clients&lt;br&gt;• tenant id comes from the request context, applied by the repository (EF global filter)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="740" x="800" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
