        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Choreography rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• each service reacts to events; nobody orchestrates&lt;br&gt;• correlationId = orderId on every event · sessions keep per-store order&lt;br&gt;• handlers are idempotent (inbox table) · compensations are business undo, not rollback&lt;br&gt;• safety net: the 15 min reservation expires on its own if no event arrives" vertex="1">
