          <mxGeometry height="28" width="74" x="304" y="838" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nHitl" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Human-in-the-loop rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every W* tool needs approval by a support agent; refunds above a limit need a supervisor.&lt;br&gt;• The approval card shows the exact tool call and parameters; parameters can&#39;t be changed by the model after approval.&lt;br&gt;• Each approval is audited (who, when, what) and linked to the ticket." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="560" x="40" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nIso" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Isolation and limits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Sub-agents see only their task + the summary they need, never another agent&#39;s raw tool output.&lt;br&gt;• Tenant ID for every tool call comes from the user&#39;s token (on-behalf-of), never from model text.&lt;br&gt;• Max 8 steps and a token budget per turn; loops are cut and handed to a human." vertex="1">
