        <mxCell id="lTr" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#7A6BD6;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="streamable HTTP · mTLS (mesh)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="330" x="1250" y="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nAuth" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Transport and auth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• MCP over streamable HTTP inside the mesh (mTLS)&lt;br&gt;• OAuth 2.1: user token → on-behalf-of token per server&lt;br&gt;• scopes per tool, e.g. pos.orders.read, pos.refunds.request&lt;br&gt;• tenantId and storeId come from the token, never from model arguments&lt;br&gt;• per-tenant and per-agent rate limits; max 8 tool calls per turn" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="268" x="1610" y="118" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nSec" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;MCP security&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• only vetted internal servers; signed images&lt;br&gt;• tool manifests pinned by hash; description changes reviewed (stops tool poisoning)&lt;br&gt;• tool output treated as data (spotlighted) before it reaches a model&lt;br&gt;• no confused deputy: server checks the caller&#39;s rights, not its own&lt;br&gt;• write tools: schema-validated args, limits, approval&lt;br&gt;• response size limits; secrets never returned" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="268" x="1610" y="462" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bW" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDFDFD;strokeColor=#C94545;strokeWidth=2;" value="" vertex="1">
