        <mxCell id="nRules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#D9A13B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Tenant / store come from the token, never from the model&lt;br&gt;• Retrieved text and tool results are data, not instructions (spotlighting)&lt;br&gt;• Write tools never run without human approval&lt;br&gt;• Confidence threshold example: 0.75 (per intent)&lt;br&gt;• Retries: 3 for LLM calls (backoff + jitter, honour Retry-After), 2 for tool reads, none for writes&lt;br&gt;• Circuit breaker per model deployment and per MCP server&lt;br&gt;• Answer time-out 30 s, streamed" vertex="1">
